                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-06-05T22:45:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 5, 1912—10.45 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>President was today authorized to suspend constitutional guaranties in Oriente
                    Province.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
